{
  "info": {
    "name": "Vio Backend API (v2 — SDK surfaces 100% clean)",
    "_postman_id": "vio-backend-api-v2-clean-2026-04-24",
    "description": "Every HTTP request in the Apple TV → iOS cart-intent v2 flow. SDK-facing folders (1 Apple TV, 2 iOS) contain **only** `/v2/*` endpoints — zero legacy.\n\nIf the iOS code is still calling legacy `/v1/*` endpoints at runtime, that gap is technical debt tracked in `docs/IOS_V2_MIGRATION_GAP.md`, not polluting this collection.\n\n**Surfaces**:\n- 1. Apple TV SDK `/v2/tv/*` (8 req)\n- 2. iOS Mobile SDK `/v2/mobile/*` + `/v2/commerce/*` + direct GraphQL (8 req)\n- 3. Commerce proxy (shortcut) (2 req)\n- 4. Admin API `/v2/admin/*` (1 req)\n- 5. Dashboard operator `/api/*` (session cookie) (6 req)\n- 6. Partner outbound (mock) (2 req)\n- 7. WebSocket reference (informational)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Setup & Health",
      "description": "Reachability check.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "0.1 GET /api/status",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/status",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "status"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Purpose**: Backend health.\n\n**Called by**: Anyone.\n\n**Expected**: 200 `{status:\"ok\", timestamp}`"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Apple TV SDK — runtime flow (100% v2)",
      "description": "HTTP requests the Apple TV SDK (`VioTVManager`) executes in order. Every URL is `/v2/tv/*`. `X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}` required.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 POST /v2/tv/broadcast/subscribe (success path)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v2/tv/broadcast/subscribe",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v2",
                "tv",
                "broadcast",
                "subscribe"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Purpose**: Combined TV bootstrap — validates broadcast + ensures end_users + upserts tv_sessions + returns campaign + sponsors + wsUrl + capabilities.\n\n**Called by**: `VioTVManager.subscribe` (Sources/VioTVCore/VioTVManager.swift:143) fired on `VioTV.connect(broadcastId:)`.\n\n**Expected**: 200 `{subscribed:true, campaignId, broadcastId, sessionId, endUserId, wsUrl, primarySponsor:{commerce:{apiKey}}, secondarySponsors, capabilities}`\n\n**Pre-conditions**: broadcast exists + campaign.primarySponsorId set + clientApp.tv_enabled + platform in tv_platforms.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"broadcastId\": \"{{broadcastId}}\",\n  \"externalUserId\": \"{{externalUserId}}\",\n  \"platform\": \"{{tvPlatform}}\",\n  \"tvDeviceId\": \"{{tvDeviceId}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.2 POST /v2/tv/broadcast/subscribe (soft-miss test)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v2/tv/broadcast/subscribe",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v2",
                "tv",
                "broadcast",
                "subscribe"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Purpose**: Validates soft-miss — broadcast not registered for this clientApp. SDK stays idle without errors.\n\n**Called by**: BroadcastPickerView \"Broadcast desconocido\" path.\n\n**Expected**: 200 `{subscribed:false, reason:\"broadcast_not_registered_for_client_app\"}`",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"broadcastId\": \"broadcast-no-existe-demo\",\n  \"externalUserId\": \"{{externalUserId}}\",\n  \"platform\": \"{{tvPlatform}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.3 (WS) wss://<host>/ws/{{campaignId}} — open + identify",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/ws/{{campaignId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "ws",
                "{{campaignId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Purpose**: Not a REST call. SDK opens WS to the `wsUrl` from 1.1. First frame: `{\"type\":\"identify\",\"userId\":\"<externalUserId>\"}`.\n\n**Called by**: `VioTVWebSocketManager.connect` (Sources/VioTVCore/Managers/VioTVWebSocketManager.swift:11).\n\n**Expected**: Listens for shoppable_ad, cart_intent, component_status_changed events. Inspect with `wscat -c <wsUrl>`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.4 POST /v2/tv/session/heartbeat (every 60s)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v2/tv/session/heartbeat",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v2",
                "tv",
                "session",
                "heartbeat"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Purpose**: Keeps `tv_sessions.last_seen_at` fresh. Fires every 60s until `VioTV.disconnect()`.\n\n**Called by**: `VioTVSessionManager.sendHeartbeat` (Sources/VioTVCore/Managers/VioTVSessionManager.swift:39).\n\n**Expected**: 200 `{ok:true, lastSeenAt}`\n\n**Pre-conditions**: sessionId from 1.1.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"sessionId\": \"{{sessionId}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.5 POST /v2/tv/broadcasts/:id/shoppable-ad (dispatch)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v2/tv/broadcasts/{{broadcastId}}/shoppable-ad",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v2",
                "tv",
                "broadcasts",
                "{{broadcastId}}",
                "shoppable-ad"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Purpose**: Dispatches a shoppable ad (source=tv-sdk). Persists shoppable_ad_activations + broadcasts WS `shoppable_ad` to campaign.\n\n**Called by**: Automation / Phase 5 smoke test dispatcher.\n\n**Expected**: 200 `{success:true, activationId, product, sponsor}` + WS fanout.\n\n**Pre-conditions**: Sponsor has avatar_url (422 SPONSOR_MISSING_AVATAR otherwise).",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"productId\": \"{{productId}}\",\n  \"sponsorId\": \"{{sponsorId}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.6 POST /v2/tv/cart-intent (remote tap)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v2/tv/cart-intent",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v2",
                "tv",
                "cart-intent"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Purpose**: TV-originated cart intent. Persists cart_intents + forwards envelope to mobile (WS direct → webhook/APNs fallback).\n\n**Called by**: `VioTVManager.sendCartIntent` (Sources/VioTVCore/VioTVManager.swift:88).\n\n**Expected**: 200 `{success:true, cartIntentId, deliveryMode}` + WS `cart_intent` to iOS.\n\n**Pre-conditions**: activationId exists in shoppable_ad_activations.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"externalUserId\": \"{{externalUserId}}\",\n  \"productId\": \"{{productId}}\",\n  \"campaignId\": \"{{campaignId}}\",\n  \"platform\": \"{{tvPlatform}}\",\n  \"activationId\": \"{{activationId}}\",\n  \"sponsorId\": \"{{sponsorId}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.7 POST /v2/tv/session/end (disconnect)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v2/tv/session/end",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v2",
                "tv",
                "session",
                "end"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Purpose**: Marks TV session ended.\n\n**Called by**: `VioTVSessionManager.sendEnd` (Sources/VioTVCore/Managers/VioTVSessionManager.swift:43) on `VioTV.disconnect()`.\n\n**Expected**: 200 `{ok:true, endedAt}`",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"sessionId\": \"{{sessionId}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.8 POST /v2/tv/session/start (standalone, not in main flow)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v2/tv/session/start",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v2",
                "tv",
                "session",
                "start"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Purpose**: Standalone session creation without subscribing. Not called by the Apple TV demo — building block for automation.\n\n**Called by**: Automation only.\n\n**Expected**: 200 `{sessionId, endUserId, startedAt}`",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"externalUserId\": \"{{externalUserId}}\",\n  \"platform\": \"{{tvPlatform}}\",\n  \"tvDeviceId\": \"{{tvDeviceId}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. iOS Mobile SDK — runtime flow (100% v2 target)",
      "description": "Target v2 surface for iOS. These are the only endpoints the SDK SHOULD call at runtime. The current iOS code still calls 9 legacy v1 endpoints — those are tracked in `docs/IOS_V2_MIGRATION_GAP.md` as debt to kill. This folder is the **contract**, not the current implementation.\n\nAll require `X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "2.A1 GET /v2/mobile/config (bootstrap)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v2/mobile/config",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v2",
                "mobile",
                "config"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Purpose**: Single bootstrap call. Returns active campaign + primary sponsor + secondaries + commerce blocks + payment methods + features. Consolidates everything the SDK needs to know about the clientApp on launch.\n\n**Called by**: `CampaignManager.bootstrapCommerceFromSdkConfig` (Sources/VioCore/Managers/CampaignManager.swift:712).\n\n**Expected**: 200 `{endpoints, campaign:{id,name,isPaused,startDate,endDate}, primarySponsor:{id,name,avatarUrl,commerce:{apiKey,channelId,paymentMethods}}, secondarySponsors:[…], features:{engagement,shoppable,lineup}}`"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2.B1 (WS) wss://<host>/ws/{{campaignId}} — open + identify",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/ws/{{campaignId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "ws",
                "{{campaignId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Purpose**: Not a REST call. SDK opens WS + sends `{\"type\":\"identify\",\"userId\":\"<externalUserId>\"}`.\n\n**Called by**: `CampaignWebSocketManager.connect` (Sources/VioCore/Managers/CampaignWebSocketManager.swift).\n\n**Expected**: Inbound events: cart_intent, shoppable_ad, component_status_changed, poll_activated, contest_activated, lineup_show, campaign_started/ended, broadcast_status_changed, ping. Outbound: identify, pong."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2.B2 GET /v2/mobile/broadcasts/:id/capabilities",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v2/mobile/broadcasts/{{broadcastId}}/capabilities",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v2",
                "mobile",
                "broadcasts",
                "{{broadcastId}}",
                "capabilities"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Purpose**: Feature flags per broadcast.\n\n**Called by**: iOS SDK when opening a broadcast-scoped view.\n\n**Expected**: 200 `{broadcastId, campaignId, engagement:{enabled,hasPolls,hasContests}, shoppable:{enabled}, lineup:{available}}`"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2.B3 GET /v2/mobile/broadcasts/:id/components (placements)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v2/mobile/broadcasts/{{broadcastId}}/components",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v2",
                "mobile",
                "broadcasts",
                "{{broadcastId}}",
                "components"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Purpose**: Active campaign_components + broadcast-scoped overrides. Each entry carries sponsor.id + commerce block for per-sponsor routing.\n\n**Called by**: 5 product views: VProductCarousel, VProductSpotlight, VProductStore, VProductBanner, VProductSlider.\n\n**Expected**: 200 `{broadcastId, components:[{id, type, locationId, sponsor:{id,name,commerce:{apiKey}}, config:{productIds}}]}`"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2.C1 GET /v2/commerce/sponsors/:id/catalog — sponsor-scoped catalog",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v2/commerce/sponsors/{{catalogSponsorId}}/catalog?limit=50",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v2",
                "commerce",
                "sponsors",
                "{{catalogSponsorId}}",
                "catalog"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "50"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Purpose**: Sponsor-scoped product catalog (proxied over Commerce GraphQL).\n\n**Called by**: `CommerceSdkClientProvider.client(forSponsorId:)` → `ProductService.loadProduct(sponsorId:)` (Sources/VioUI/Services/ProductService.swift:46).\n\n**Expected**: 200 `{sponsorId, products:[{id,name,price,currency,imageUrl}]}`"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2.C2 (External) POST {{commerceUrl}} — Commerce GraphQL direct",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer <sponsor commerce_api_key>",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{commerceUrl}}",
              "host": [
                "{{commerceUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "{{commerceUrl}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Purpose**: **Different host** — iOS SDK calls Commerce GraphQL directly for product load. Uses sponsor's `commerce_api_key` from 2.A1. On 401, SDK re-fetches 2.A1 via `runWithCommerceAuthRetry`.\n\n**Called by**: `CommerceSdkClientProvider` GraphQL client.\n\n**Expected**: 200 with products. 401 triggers config re-fetch.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"query\": \"{ Channel { GetProducts(limit: 20) { id name price { amount currency } images { url } } } }\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2.D1 POST /v2/mobile/campaigns/:id/cart-intent (in-app Add to cart)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v2/mobile/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/cart-intent",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v2",
                "mobile",
                "campaigns",
                "{{campaignId}}",
                "cart-intent"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Purpose**: Mobile-originated cart intent (user tapped Add to cart inside the iOS app).\n\n**Called by**: `VioCampaignPartnerAPI.sendCartIntent` (Sources/VioCore/Network/VioCampaignPartnerAPI.swift:27).\n\n**Expected**: 200 `{ok:true, cartIntentId, deliveryMode}`",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"userId\": \"{{externalUserId}}\",\n  \"productId\": \"{{productId}}\",\n  \"productName\": \"Samsung QLED\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2.D2 POST /v2/mobile/campaigns/:id/register-device (APNs/FCM)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v2/mobile/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/register-device",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v2",
                "mobile",
                "campaigns",
                "{{campaignId}}",
                "register-device"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Purpose**: Registers APNs/FCM token. Backend forwards to partner's partnerDeviceRegisterUrl (see folder 6.2) if set.\n\n**Called by**: `VioCampaignPartnerAPI.registerDevice` (Sources/VioCore/Network/VioCampaignPartnerAPI.swift:70).\n\n**Expected**: 200 `{success:true}`. Triggers outbound partner POST.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"userId\": \"{{externalUserId}}\",\n  \"deviceToken\": \"apns-hex-<fill>\",\n  \"platform\": \"ios\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Commerce proxy (/v2/commerce/*)",
      "description": "Sponsor-scoped Commerce endpoints. Same items as 2.C1/2.C2, grouped here for direct access.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "3.1 GET /v2/commerce/sponsors/:id/catalog",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v2/commerce/sponsors/{{catalogSponsorId}}/catalog?limit=50",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v2",
                "commerce",
                "sponsors",
                "{{catalogSponsorId}}",
                "catalog"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "50"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Purpose**: Sponsor-scoped product catalog proxy.\n\n**Called by**: Dashboard SponsorCatalogPicker + iOS product load.\n\n**Expected**: 200 `{sponsorId, products:[…]}`"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3.2 GET /v2/commerce/products (raw)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v2/commerce/products?sponsorId={{catalogSponsorId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v2",
                "commerce",
                "products"
