    {
      "name": "7. WebSocket events (reference)",
      "description": "WS at `wss://<host>/ws/:campaignId`. Both SDKs connect here. Not runnable in Postman.\n\n**Server → client events**:\n- `shoppable_ad` (activationId, sponsorId, product, sponsor)\n- `cart_intent` (canonical envelope)\n- `component_status_changed` (sponsorId at root)\n- `poll_activated` / `poll_deactivated` / `poll_results_updated`\n- `contest_activated` / `contest_deactivated`\n- `lineup_show`\n- `campaign_started` / `campaign_ended`\n- `broadcast_status_changed`\n- `ping` (client replies `{\"type\":\"pong\"}`)\n\n**Client → server**:\n- `{\"type\":\"identify\",\"userId\":\"<externalUserId>\"}` (first frame, required)\n- `{\"type\":\"pong\"}`\n\nDedup: iOS dedups cart_intent by activationId in `CampaignManager.publishCartIntentIfChanged`.",
      "item": []
    },
